---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact | freellm.site"
  description="Get in touch with the freellm.site team — report outdated provider info, suggest new providers, or ask questions."
>
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl py-4 dark:prose-invert prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-primary">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      We'd love to hear from you — whether you're reporting outdated provider info, suggesting a new provider, or just saying hello.
    </p>

    <div class="not-prose my-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_p]:mb-2 [&_p]:text-sm [&_p]:text-muted-foreground">
        <h2>GitHub Issues</h2>
        <p>Report outdated data, request new providers, or discuss features:</p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/khushaljethava/freellm-apis/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium">Open an issue on GitHub →</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_p]:mb-2 [&_p]:text-sm [&_p]:text-muted-foreground">
        <h2>Contribute</h2>
        <p>Submit a pull request with updated provider or model data:</p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/khushaljethava/freellm-apis" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium">freellm-apis repository →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Response time</h2>
    <p>We aim to respond to GitHub issues within a few business days. Provider data corrections are typically reviewed and merged within a week.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
